==============================================================================

  include/hybrid_alloc.hpp follows the threshold, marker-ahead-of-pointer
  dispatch, and size computation of the Windows Kits 10 UCRT
  (ucrt/malloc.h `_malloca` / `_freea`, `_ALLOCA_S_THRESHOLD`,
  `_MarkAllocaS`, `_MallocaComputeSize`).
